Note that Milestone 1 verifies variables, English arithmetic expressions, precedence, and native ELF64 binary execution.

Display text of Eathon Native Execution Milestone 1 end text.

Let base be integer 120.
Let factor be integer 4.
Let bonus be integer 35.

Note that multiplication binds tighter than addition in Eathon deterministic grammar.
Let total be base plus factor times bonus.
Display total.

Let difference be total minus 60.
Display difference.

Let quotient be difference divided by 5.
Display quotient.

Let remainder be total modulo 7.
Display remainder.

Set base to base plus 80.
Display base.
